    <briefdescription>
<para>Decorator that owns the heartbeat and periodically drives TMotor. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classevam_1_1_sampled_decor" kindref="compound">SampledDecor</ref> stores the target value and, on every heartbeat, forwards it to TMotor::Go(). Any filter decorators wrapped inside transform the value in their own <ref refid="classevam_1_1_sampled_decor_1a300acc4375b12874d640343e45bd1e03" kindref="member">Go()</ref> before it reaches the motor.</para>
<para>Usage: <ref refid="classevam_1_1_sampled_decor" kindref="compound">SampledDecor&lt;SimpleSmoothDecor&lt;MyMotor, 5&gt;&gt;</ref> a;</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>TMotor</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Wrapped class (must implement <ref refid="classevam_1_1_sampled_decor_1a300acc4375b12874d640343e45bd1e03" kindref="member">Go(signed short)</ref>) </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
